                        </p>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                            <a href="https://github.com/leynos/weaver/blob/main/docs/adr-007-agent-native-command-surface.md" target="_blank" class="group block p-6 bg-white border border-base-content/10 rounded-xs relative overflow-hidden hover:border-accent/40 transition-colors">
